      <div class="task-route"><p class="task-route-num">02 / DIMENSIONS OR A SKETCH</p><h3>Model from your information</h3><p>We can work from drawings and supplied measurements where they describe the part sufficiently. We agree the critical dimensions and how the finished part will be checked.</p></div>
